title: Perplexity per KV type pair, K type / V type  (R1 7B Q4_K_S, -ngl 28, 4096-token chunks of the repo docs)
args: -m /home/wrekt/.lmstudio/models/mradermacher/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B-Uncensored-i1-GGUF/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B-Uncensored.i1-Q4_K_S.gguf -f local-tune/results/ppl-corpus.txt -c 4096 -b 512 --chunks 16 -ngl 28 -t 6 -fa on
